        "locator": "L22-L67 (Migration Guide: From v2 to v3 › Static configuration › Docker & Docker Swarm › SwarmMode)",
        "excerpt": "#### SwarmMode\n\nIn v3, the provider Docker has been split into 2 providers:\n\n- Docker provider (without Swarm support)\n- Swarm provider  (Swarm support only)\n\n??? example \"An example usage of v2 Docker provider with Swarm\"\n\n    ```yaml tab=\"File (YAML)\"\n    providers:\n      docker:\n        swarmMode: true\n    ```\n\n    ```toml tab=\"File (TOML)\"\n    [providers.docker]\n        swarmMode=true\n    ```\n\n    ```bash tab=\"CLI\"\n    --providers.docker.swarmMode=true\n    ```\n\nThis configuration is now unsupported and would prevent Traefik to start.\n\n##### Remediation\n\nIn v3, the `swarmMode` should not be…",
